<title>BELGIUM: Glaverbel to announce dividend April 11.</title>
<headline>Glaverbel to announce dividend April 11.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian glass maker Glaverbel, controlled by Japan's Asahi Glass Co. Ltd, said on Thursday it would announce its 1996 dividend on April 11.</p>
<p>The dividend will be proposed by the board at Glaverbel's annual shareholders' meeting on May 28.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
